WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.618
- We wanna take a moment to congratulate

00:00:01.618 --> 00:00:03.236
our Governors Awards Honorees.

00:00:03.236 --> 00:00:05.088
(audience laughing)

00:00:05.088 --> 00:00:08.491
Danny Glover received the Hersholt Award.

00:00:08.491 --> 00:00:11.478
In addition, Elaine May, Liv Ullmann,

00:00:11.478 --> 00:00:14.297
and Samuel L. Jackson received Oscars.

00:00:14.297 --> 00:00:16.616
Liv Ullmann and Samuel L.
Jackson are here tonight

00:00:16.616 --> 00:00:17.817
and we celebrate all of you.

00:00:17.817 --> 00:00:20.353
And we thank you for your
contributions to cinema.

00:00:20.353 --> 00:00:21.187
(audience clapping)

00:00:21.187 --> 00:00:22.872
Yes.

